  "quotes": [
    {
      "block": "原句1",
      "no": 1,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "There’s no way to mark the passage of time here. There’s no window I can look out of and no clock",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 19
        },
        {
          "text": "My phone is frozen at 8:44 p.m. That must be when I died",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 116
        }
      ],
      "words": 35
    },
    {
      "block": "原句2",
      "no": 2,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "Whatever Jess had been typing is permanently frozen as three little dots in our chat",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 174
        },
        {
          "text": "I wish I could text my sister and ask her how to fix this. The realization that I can’t just makes me cry harder",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 377
        }
      ],
      "words": 40
    },
    {
      "block": "原句3",
      "no": 3,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I examine some of the titles and decide that, yeah—these books were not written for a human audience",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 741
        },
        {
          "text": "The Reaper Handbook (Unabridged 150th Edition)",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 843
        },
        {
          "text": "The Wit and Wisdom of the Mids",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 890
        },
        {
          "text": "All I Need to Know I Learned in the Break Room: A Collection of Essays",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 921
        }
      ],
      "words": 49
    },
    {
      "block": "原句4",
      "no": 4,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "There is no room for sentiment in Reaping. New Reapers must learn to subdue any lingering human emotions they might have",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1161
        },
        {
          "text": "Lack of emotions is what separates Us from Them",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1310
        },
        {
          "text": "Were Reapers human once",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 1438
        }
      ],
      "words": 41
    },
    {
      "block": "原句5",
      "no": 5,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "It’s probably—definitely—a bad idea. But I can’t stay in here one second longer while a corporate entity decides whether",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 3110
        },
        {
          "text": "“Why didn’t you wait like I told you to?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 5296
        },
        {
          "text": "“They’re giving you eight more weeks. After that, you will die again, and will return here with me.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 6930
        },
        {
          "text": "If I only have eight weeks, I’ll just have to make the most of them",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 7826
        }
      ],
      "words": 68
    },
    {
      "block": "原句6",
      "no": 6,
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "I can’t have heard that right. “Observing me?”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8322
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yes,” he confirms. “You have information the Agency wants.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 8366
        },
        {
          "text": "“The ritual has not been performed in millennia. It’s not included in our training.”",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 10506
        },
        {
          "text": "It’s my soul—I’m certain of it—flooding my senses and lighting me up from within",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12413
        },
        {
          "text": "And then, once again, there is nothing",
          "ok": true,
          "pos": 12512
        }
      ],
      "words": 56
    }
  ],
